    given-names: Hamza
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9530-2815"
repository-code: "https://github.com/hentablihamza/practical-cheminformatics-course"
url: "https://github.com/hentablihamza/practical-cheminformatics-course"
abstract: >
  A hands-on, 12-notebook course that takes a beginner from Python and RDKit basics to
  building, validating, and deploying QSAR models and virtual screens, using small real
  public datasets (Delaney ESOL, ChEMBL). Every notebook runs in Google Colab with one click.
keywords:
  - cheminformatics
  - RDKit
  - drug discovery
  - QSAR
  - machine learning
  - virtual screening
  - education
  - tutorial
